{"product_id":"the-art-of-captaincy","title":"The art of captaincy","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn cricket, the role of the captain has been consistently under-rated in recent years. In time where statistics are the fashion, the performance of batsmen and bowlers can readily be presented in terms of averages whereas the contribution of the captain is, by contrast, harder to assess. But in cricket more than any other sport the role of the leader is crucial.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Mike Brearley\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781447294351\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 304\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 28 x 200\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Bookhero.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595764142233,"sku":"4RB9781447294351","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/the-art-of-captaincy-643741.jpg?v=1694791842","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-art-of-captaincy","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}